      "content": "To make the contrast sharply visible, consider giving the Low-Tier citizens noticeable physical markers of their environment, such as deeper skin tones from necessary outdoor labor and harsher lighting. Their hair and features could be more varied and naturally textured—thicker, harsher, or less meticulously groomed than the elites' standardized presentation. Scarring, perhaps from accidents or necessary defense within their districts, would be a constant, visible narrative of their struggle. These gritty, organic details will immediately signal their difference upon sight.",
